flowchart TD
    A[Normal Automation] --> B{Evidence complete and systems healthy?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Act]
    B -- No --> D[Degraded Mode]

    D --> E{Risk low?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Assist / Recommend Only]
    E -- No --> G[Pending Review]

    G --> H{High risk or unsafe?}
    H -- No --> I[Human Review]
    H -- Yes --> J[Hard Stop / Refuse]

    C --> K[Replay Card]
    F --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K
